00:02:48.680 --> 00:02:49.680
That's a lot.

00:02:49.680 --> 00:02:51.520
All of a sudden, you need hundreds of thousands.

00:02:51.520 --> 00:02:53.400
And you're not talking about.

00:02:53.400 --> 00:02:55.780
The mask is whether it's plastic or whether
it's material.

00:02:55.780 --> 00:02:56.840
