00:03:25.630 --> 00:03:26.660
Take a look at this.

00:03:26.660 --> 00:03:30.570
It doesn't include what will be produced,
as is the president said.

00:03:30.570 --> 00:03:34.750
We're seeing companies step forward with these
manufacturers.

00:03:34.750 --> 00:03:38.340
Tell us that a ventilator actually isn't a
very complicated piece of equipment, and many

00:03:38.340 --> 00:03:42.680
of them are literally surging forward to create
